            "id": "110910227634454916",
            "user_id": "109427035405484528",
            "content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.au/@Bellingen\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Bellingen</span></a></span> Would water really have helped with a massive fire driven by 100kph winds? I kinda doubt it. I think we want to believe we could have done something if only X, but seems to me everyone was just at the mercy of nature in that fire cause there\u2019s nothing humans could have done to change anything about that fire once it started</p>"
